      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. if you look at the british side of things during those years, do they have any legitimate justifications for why they were doing what they were doing, or was it just pure exploitation? like was there any actual logic to their so called \"civilizing mission\" or was it just a cover for the land theft?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
